  m_text: "A compass is a navigation tool that uses a freely rotating magnetic needle
    to show direction. Earth behaves like a giant magnet, and its magnetic field
    causes the marked end of the needle to align toward Magnetic North. The compass
    dial displays the four cardinal directions\u2014North, East, South, and West\u2014and
    the four intermediate directions. When using a compass with a map, rotate the
    map until its north direction aligns with the compass needle."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
